From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TurboVadim <yolkin.vadim@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:46:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Default asynchronous mob counting to disabled

Restore synchronous Paper count timing by default. Describe the tick-thread snapshot and delayed-count behavior of the opt-in mode.

diff --git a/java/org/dreeam/leaf/config/modules/async/AsyncMobSpawning.java b/java/org/dreeam/leaf/config/modules/async/AsyncMobSpawning.java
index a352f06c864f4c87f4c9f682a40b775c6b3bb27a..0be5137ca427bd3963f28d3adfaec103cf2e871d 100644
--- a/java/org/dreeam/leaf/config/modules/async/AsyncMobSpawning.java
+++ b/java/org/dreeam/leaf/config/modules/async/AsyncMobSpawning.java
@@ -9,20 +9,19 @@ public class AsyncMobSpawning extends ConfigModule {
         return ConfigCategory.ASYNC.basePath() + ".async-mob-spawning";
     }
 
-    public static boolean enabled = true;
+    public static boolean enabled = false;
     private static boolean asyncMobSpawningInitialized;
 
     @Override
     public void onLoaded() {
         globalConfig.addCommentRegionBased(basePath(), """
-                Whether or not asynchronous mob spawning should be enabled.
-                On servers with many entities, this can improve performance by up to 15%. You must have
-                paper's per-player-mob-spawns setting set to true for this to work.
-                One quick note - this does not actually spawn mobs async (that would be very unsafe).
-                This just offloads some expensive calculations that are required for mob spawning.""",
+                Offload mob count aggregation using a snapshot captured on the world tick thread.
+                Requires Paper's per-player-mob-spawns setting. Counts come from an earlier tick,
+                and spawning waits while aggregation is unfinished. Disabled by default for Paper timing.""",
             """
                 是否异步化生物生成.
-                在实体较多的服务器上, 异步生成可最高带来 15% 的性能提升.
+                在世界线程捕获快照后异步统计生物数量, 使用先前 tick 的计数.
+                统计未完成时暂停自然生成, 默认关闭以保持 Paper 的时序.
                 须在Paper配置文件中打开 per-player-mob-spawns 才能生效.""");
 
         // This prevents us from changing the value during a reload.
